PROJECT EXPLANATION - STEP BY STEP
What is this project?
This is a restaurant booking web application where:

🍽️ Restaurant Owners can register their restaurant, set available time slots, and manage bookings
👥 Customers can browse restaurants and book tables
⚙️ Admin reviews and approves new restaurants
Think of it like Zomato or BookMyShow - but focused on table reservations.

