2️⃣ TYPESCRIPT (Programming Language)
What is TypeScript?

JavaScript with type checking
Catches errors BEFORE running code
Safer than plain JavaScript
Example:

TSX
// Without TypeScript (JavaScript) - ERROR might happen
function addNumbers(a, b) {
  return a + b; // What if 'a' is text? Crashes!
}

// With TypeScript - ERROR caught immediately
function addNumbers(a: number, b: number): number {
  return a + b; // Forces numbers only!
}
Why use it? 🔒 Prevents bugs, makes code cleaner

3️⃣ TAILWIND CSS (Styling)
What is Tailwind?

Write CSS using class names
No need to write .css files
Example:

TSX
<button className="bg-blue-500 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded">
  Click Me
</button>
Instead of:

